From eaa7247d77aa2cbc42e5d9827c451ee80c6c8b41 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zhangxujia <xujiaz2000@163.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:26:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(model): initialize GLM MTP embeddings for pipeline
 parallelism

Load the checkpoint input embedding before filtering for GLM MTP layers
and record local embedding ownership. The last pipeline stage cannot share
the target embedding from the first stage; leaving its draft copy unloaded
caused low MTP acceptance. Preserve MTP-specific embedding precedence and
the existing no-PP sharing path.

Skip legitimate zero-element MLA components in the MRV2 KV block zeroer.
NoPE checkpoints can expose an empty RoPE view that otherwise launches a
zero-width grid on the first request.

Validated with 35 related unit tests, format.sh ci, and BF16 GSM8K160 on
16 Ascend NPUs: ordinary PP, async MTP3/5/7+PP, and no-PP ordinary/MTP3.

Signed-off-by: zhangxujia <xujiaz2000@163.com>
